<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Architecture Redesign</=
strong>: I implemented a <strong>hybrid approach</strong>:
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
