<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5">Real-world Trade=
-offs Analysis:</h3>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">In my experience at TechCorp, I'=
ve used all three in different contexts:</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>React Query for our main=
 dashboard</strong> (chose over SWR):</p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Pros</strong>: Superior=
 optimistic updates for trading operations, better error retry mechanisms, =
excellent background refetching</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Cons</strong>: Larger b=
undle size (+12kb vs SWR's 4kb), steeper learning curve for junior develope=
rs</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>SWR for our notification=
