<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Pros</strong>: Simpler =
API, better WebSocket integration, lightweight</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Cons</strong>: Less sop=
histicated caching strategies, limited optimistic update patterns</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Redux for complex form s=
tate and UI interactions</strong>:</p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Pros</strong>: Predicta=
ble updates, excellent DevTools, team familiarity</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Cons</strong>: Boilerpl=
ate overhead, not ideal for server state synchronization</li>
</ul>
