 for collaborative editing to reduce latency globally</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Advanced compression al=
gorithms</strong> using machine learning</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Real-time collaborative=
 debugging</strong> for our developer tools</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Autonomy &amp; Architect=
ural Influence</strong>:</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Senior Engineers here have <stro=
ng>significant architectural autonomy</strong>. You'd participate in our <s=
trong>monthly architecture review council</strong>, propose and drive <stro=
ng>design documents</strong> for major features, and have input on team roa=
dmap planning.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Your systems design skills would=
 be particularly valued - we need engineers who can <strong>think at Google=
 scale</strong> from day one. The distributed consensus knowledge you demon=
strated would be directly applicable to several projects we're planning.</p=
>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>What excites me most</st=
rong> about your candidacy is that you clearly <strong>think in systems</st=
rong>, not just features. That's exactly what we need for the challenges ah=
ead.</p>
